      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had realized I was mistaken about \"only appears in your own profile\" (I only checked this specific feature in v1878 and it simply didn't appear for the user in my instance)\n\nBut I still don't believe it should appear in your local profile. Nor that it should appear above groups.",
